#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository so that the same blob is
# produced on every branch and platform. Without this, identical sources are
# stored with different line endings per branch, and any cross-branch diff or
# migration shows whole-file rewrites instead of the real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Linux start script should use lf
/gradlew        text eol=lf

# These are Windows script files and should use crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf

# Binary assets must never be normalized
*.png           binary
*.jar           binary
